                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Transference is a pretty cool VR experience. I had a copy on PSVR for PS4 and enjoyed it few years ago and seen it was on PC so i grabbed me another copy, interesting story, decent puzzles to solve, very nice crisp graphics, works great with either controller or VR controls, its worth the price tag and a playthru especially if your new to the VR experience and want a decent game to try",
